PTX cub-select-inplace-war
"CUB in-place stream compaction: tile i loads its input, the block synchronizes, and thread 0 publishes the tile state with st.release.gpu; tile j reads the state with ld.acquire.gpu and then writes its output over tile i's input (CCCL cub/agent/agent_select_if.cuh:214-221, the acquire_release order). Tile i's load must not read tile j's later store. Expected: forbidden."
{
x=1;
f=0;
P0:r0=0;
P2:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0 | P2@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0 ;
 ld.weak.global r0, x     | bar.sync 1, 2            | ld.acquire.gpu r1, f     ;
 bar.sync 1, 2            | st.release.gpu f, 1      | st.weak.global x, 2      ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 2 /\ P2:r1 == 1)
